detailed_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, continues from <Video 1>.

At 00:00.000, The kitchen is in a wide view: Amy stands centered with the large fridge to her right (the back wall). In front of her she holds a compact pistol in her left hand and a katana in her right, both held upright. Behind the closed latch of the closet doorway on the far left side are Will1 and Amber1 peeking from behind the door. Zombie1 slumps on the counter opposite Amy’s chair, clutching an eggs bowl with his hand.

At 00:01.000, The back door swings open a fraction; through it staggers the first zombie (Zombie2_1), its limbs uncoordinated and head tilted as it makes slow steps toward Amy.

At 00:02.500, Amy reacts instantly, raising her pistol to aim at Zombie2_1’s exposed skull while keeping her katana steady in the other hand.

At 00:04.000, Amy pulls the trigger; a sharp crack echoes as one bullet flies straight into Zombie2_1’s bone.

At 00:06.300, The impact knocks Zombie2_1 forward, and it collapses onto the kitchen floor near Amy, still twitching with a slow shudder of its arms.

overall_soundscape: slow zombie footstep, sharp gunshot crack, thud of zombie falling

non_diegetic_music: continues from <Video 1>. A triumphant brass fanfare rises over the lingering drumbeat as the pistol crack echoes, punctuating the sudden collapse with bright chords.

